{"seq":25,"trial_id":"v04-transfer-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-live-mu-v04-rehearsal/rx-06-wv2db9/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T14:51:04.506Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e9b7bca099109e68f2ecc693b14f9642fef597a27c7729cf539ac3a8b8695843","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04TRA0001","text":"Hi Linnea, here's what I found for Sablehithe Paper Mill (SPM, a Canyon account owned by Sebastien Keldale):\n\n- Renewal date: December 10, 2026, per Moss's Canyon digest from Sept 3. That doesn't match the January 20, 2027 you mentioned from memory in #sierra-team on May 1. The digest is the more recent written source, but Sebastien is the person to confirm it.\n- Main contact: Lysander Vesfield, Transportation Manager at Sablehithe Paper Mill, leads the Indigo rollout on their side (from the Canyon cheat sheet, updated Sept 28)."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04TRA0001","ts":"1792245600.000132"}}
